<newsitem itemid="79526" id="root" date="1996-09-26" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Huntleigh Technolgy H1 pretax profit up.</title>
<headline>Huntleigh Technolgy H1 pretax profit up.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		18.55		  vs 16.82</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.0		    vs 3.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     7.96		   vs 7.17</p>
<p> Turnover		   48.24		  vs 47.48</p>
<p> Operating result	 7.62		   vs 7.02</p>
<p> Interest		   0.15		   vs 0.26</p>
<p> Tax			  2.69		   vs 2.40</p>
<p> Net taxed		  5.27		   vs 4.77</p>
<p> Pay date		   November 1</p>
<p> Div registration date  October 22</p>
<p> Ex-div date		October 14</p>
<p>Note - Huntleigh Technology Plc said the long term demand for group products remained strong. It said that ordinary shares would be admitted to the official list subject to London stock exchange approval in November, 1996.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
</text>
